7:\"translate-livesearch-button\";s:15:\"See all results\";s:19:\"translate-404-title\";s:18:\"Ooops... Error 404\";s:22:\"translate-404-subtitle\";s:62:\"We are sorry, but the page you are looking for does not exist.\";s:18:\"translate-404-text\";s:46:\"Please check entered address and try again or \";s:17:\"translate-404-btn\";s:14:\"go to homepage\";s:5:\"gdpr2\";s:0:\"\";s:24:\"gdpr2-settings-animation\";s:4:\"fade\";s:28:\"gdpr2-settings-cookie_expire\";s:3:\"365\";s:19:\"gdpr2-content-title\";s:7:\"Consent\";s:21:\"gdpr2-consent-content\";s:410:\"<p><strong>This website uses cookies</strong></p>\r\n<p>We use cookies to personalise content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyse our traffic. We also share information about your use of our site with our social media, advertising and analytics partners who may combine it with other information that you’ve provided to them or that they’ve collected from your use of their services.</p>\";s:19:\"gdpr2-details-title\";s:7:\"Details\";s:21:\"gdpr2-necessary-title\";s:9:\"Necessary\";s:23:\"gdpr2-necessary-consent\";s:203:\"<p>Necessary cookies help make a website usable by enabling basic functions like page navigation and access to secure areas of the website. The website cannot function properly without these cookies.</p>\";s:21:\"gdpr2-analytics-title\";s:23:\"Analytics & Performance\";s:23:\"gdpr2-analytics-consent\";s:147:\"<p>Statistic cookies help website owners to understand how visitors interact with websites by collecting and reporting information anonymously.</p>\";s:21:\"gdpr2-marketing-title\";s:9:\"Marketing\";s:23:\"gdpr2-marketing-consent\";s:225:\"<p>Marketing cookies are used to track visitors across websites. The intention is to display ads that are relevant and engaging for the individual user and thereby more valuable for publishers and third party advertisers.</p>\";s:17:\"gdpr2-about-title\";s:13:\"About Cookies\";s:19:\"gdpr2-about-content\";s:959:\"<p>Cookies are small text files that can be used by websites to make a user\'s experience more efficient.</p>\r\n<p>The law states that we can store cookies on your device if they are strictly necessary for the operation of this site. For all other types of cookies we need your permission. This means that cookies which are categorized as necessary, are processed based on GDPR Art. 6 (1) (f). All other cookies, meaning those from the categories preferences and marketing, are processed based on GDPR Art. 6 (1) (a) GDPR.</p>\r\n<p>This site uses different types of cookies. Some cookies are placed by third party services that appear on our pages.</p>\r\n<p>You can at any time change or withdraw your consent from the Cookie Declaration on our website.</p>\r\n<p>Learn more about who we are, how you can contact us and how we process personal data in our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p>Please state your consent ID and date when you contact us regarding your consent.</p>\";s:17:\"gdpr2-button-deny\";s:4:\"Deny\";s:22:\"gdpr2-button-customize\";s:9:\"Customize\";s:27:\"gdpr2-button-allow-selected\";s:14:\"Allow selected\";s:22:\"gdpr2-button-allow-all\";s:9:\"Allow all\";s:26:\"gdpr2-color-container-font\";s:7:\"#626262\";s:33:\"gdpr2-color-container-font-strong\";s:7:\"#07070a\";s:21:\"gdpr2-color-container\";s:7:\"#ffffff\";s:19:\"gdpr2-color-overlay\";s:18:\"rgba(25,37,48,0.6)\";s:26:\"gdpr2-color-details-box-bg\";s:7:\"#fbfbfb\";s:26:\"gdpr2-color-details-switch\";s:7:\"#00032a\";s:33:\"gdpr2-color-details-switch-active\";s:7:\"#5acb65\";s:21:\"gdpr2-tabs-text-color\";s:7:\"#07070a\";s:28:\"gdpr2-tabs-text-color-active\";s:7:\"#0089f7\";s:17:\"gdpr2-tabs-border\";s:16:\"rgba(8,8,14,0.1)\";s:22:\"gdpr2-color-buttons-bg\";a:2:{s:6:\"normal\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"hover\";s:0:\"\";}s:19:\"gdpr2-color-buttons\";a:2:{s:6:\"normal\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"hover\";s:0:\"\";}s:26:\"gdpr2-color-buttons-border\";a:2:{s:6:\"normal\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"hover\";s:0:\"\";}s:29:\"gdpr2-color-buttons-bg-active\";a:2:{s:6:\"normal\";s:0:\"\"