(2519, 1084, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"9ae2c59\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"wider\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8888\\/garedigolf.it\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/06\\/ski3-section-bg5.webp\",\"id\":52,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"top right\",\"background_repeat_tablet\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size_tablet\":\"contain\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bfbe26c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":55,\"_inline_size_tablet\":80},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4b10246\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c174b92\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9e63f0c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"CONTATTI\",\"header_size\":\"h6\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"eb05820\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"IL GOLF QUANDO E DOVE VUOI \",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"a61cf81\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1fcc05d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"70685f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Orari Segreteria\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f88dd94\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Marted\\u00ec \\u2013 Venerd\\u00ec:<br \\/>10:00 AM \\u2013 19:00 PM<br \\/><br \\/><br \\/>Sabato \\u2013 Domenica:<br \\/>08:00 AM \\u2013 16:00 PM<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1d7adbc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0e672c2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"La nostra missione\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e8eb5f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Rendiamo il golf accessibile e senza stress, offrendo un servizio semplice, veloce e flessibile. Prenota le tue gare in pochi passaggi, pianifica con libert\\u00e0 e gestisci il tuo tempo senza vincoli, garantendo un\\u2019esperienza su misura per ogni golfista.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9344668\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"La nostra storia\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"ff32c13\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>Dal 2013, Garedigolf.it<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> si distingue per la sua <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>esperienza<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> e <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>passione<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> nell\\u2019organizzazione e gestione di circuiti di golf in tutta Italia. Un vero <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>punto di riferimento<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> per i golfisti che desiderano scoprire e giocare nei <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>migliori campi<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> del Paese, offrendo un accesso esclusivo alle <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>gare pi\\u00f9 prestigiose<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> nei Golf Club italiani. <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>Garedigolf.it<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> \\u00e8 l\\u2019unica piattaforma che consente di <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>prenotare<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> o <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>acquistare il green fee<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> per le migliori competizioni, anche con largo anticipo, garantendo il <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>posto riservato<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> e sempre il <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>miglior prezzo<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>. Con un calendario di oltre <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>150 gare all\\u2019anno<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>, offre agli appassionati la possibilit\\u00e0 di giocare con amici sia nei <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>weekend<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> che nei <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>giorni infrasettimanali<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>. Inoltre, \\u00e8 il <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>partner ideale<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">strong<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> per le aziende che desiderano rafforzare la propria immagine e <span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span>promuovere prodotti e servizi<span class=\\\"hljs-tag\\\">&lt;\\/<span class=\\\"hljs-name\\\">em<\\/span>&gt;<\\/span> in un ambiente esclusivo e ricco di opportunit\\u00e0, come quello del golf.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"4ff0584\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"struc