ort-icon5.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Premi in argento 18/10</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon6.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Premiazione e buffet</h5>				\n					<h6>THE RESORT</h6>				\n					<h2>CHOOSE THE  <br>PERFECT ROOM</h2>				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic1.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic2.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic3.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic3\" /></figure>			\n															<img width=\"1128\" height=\"843\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4.webp 1128w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-500x374.webp 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-300x224.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-768x574.webp 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-100x75.webp 100w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-480x359.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:1128px) 100vw, 1128px\" />															\n					<h2>BLACK<br>MOUNTAIN</h2>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Ski slope</h4><p>5.8 MILES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon2.svg\" ti