(967, 1, '2025-01-17 02:38:43', '2025-01-17 01:38:43', '<h6>I CIRCUITI</h6>				\n					<h2>LE MIGLIORI ECCELLENZE ITALIANE</h2>				\n		<strong>Garedigolf.it, forte dell’esperienza trentennale di Roberto Bianchi</strong> nell’organizzazione di eventi e circuiti, offre un pacchetto competitivo e completo per promuovere i vostri prodotti nei migliori golf club d’Italia.		\n					<a href=\"mailto:info@garedigolf.it\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									RICHIEDI UN PREVENTIVO\n					</a>\n		<h4>4,9</h4><p>[progress_icons icon=\"icon-star\" count=\"5\" active=\"5\" background=\"#003C9D\" transparent=\"1\"]</p><p><a href=\"https://it.trustpilot.com/review/garedigolf.it\">User reviews</a></p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Giocatori partecipano ogni anno alle nostre gare, in tutta Italia, dalla Valle d’Aosta alla Sicilia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Le gare giocate su territorio nazionale nei migliori Club d’Italia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				 ANNI\n		<p>Con passione e professionalità svolgiamo il nostro lavoro per farvi divertire.</p>		\n															<img width=\"893\" height=\"793\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4.webp 893w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4-500x444.webp 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4-300x266.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4-768x682.webp 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4-84x75.webp 84w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-wrap-bg4-480x426.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:893px) 100vw, 893px\" />															\n					<h6>THE RESORT</h6>				\n					<h2>QUIS PARTURIENT SAGITTIS TRISTIQUE</h2>				\n		<p>Consequat gravida pharetra porttitor et pulvinar augue quis tincidunt. Turpis diam nisl ornare eget facilisis. Ut turpis mollis convallis ipsum in orci tortor. Lobortis consequat porta eleifend facilisis. Felis nisi adipiscing cras mollis interdum mi odio. Nunc pulvinar vitae praesent nulla rhoncus dictum. Quisque sociis purus consectetur sem ut.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/contact/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									BOOK A VISIT\n					</a>\n					<h6>SERVIZI</h6>				\n					<h2>I SERVIZI  <br>CHE OFFRIAMO</h2>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Area Ospitalità</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon2.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Hostess</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon3.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Accoglienza e consegna score</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon4.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Cartellonisitca sul campo</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon5.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Premi in argento 18/10</h5>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-icon6.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h5>Premiazione e buffet</h5>				\n					<h6>I NOSTRI CIRCUITI</h6>				\n					<h2>SCEGLI IL PIù <br>ADATTO A TE</h2>				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic1.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic2.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic3.webp\" alt=\"ski3-resort-pic3\" /></figure>			\n															<img width=\"1128\" height=\"843\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4.webp 1128w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-500x374.webp 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-300x224.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-768x574.webp 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-100x75.webp 100w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-resort-pic4-480x359.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:1128px) 100vw, 1128px\" />															\n					<h2>BLACK<br>MOUNTAIN</h2>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Ski slope</h4><p>5.8 MILES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon2.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\