Read more</a></li></ul>\n		<p>CHI<br />SIAMO</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/resort/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									THE MOUNTAIN\n					</a>\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Ski slope</h4><p>5.8 MILES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon2.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Time</h4><p>~15 MINUTES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon3.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Prices</h4><p>FROM $8</p>				\n															<img width=\"1882\" height=\"952\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3.webp 1882w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-500x253.webp 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-1200x607.webp 1200w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-300x152.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-768x388.webp 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-1536x777.webp 1536w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-148x75.webp 148w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-480x243.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:1882px) 100vw, 1882px\" />															\n		<p>13:00</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>START</h6>				\n		<p>avg 20 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>3KM</h6>				\n		<p>avg 12 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>6KM</h6>				\n		<p>avg 23 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>12KM</h6>				\n					<h6>I CIRCUITI</h6>				\n					<h2>LE MIGLIORI \nECCELLENZE \nITALIANE</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Garedigolf.it, forte dell\'esperienza trentennale di Roberto Bianchi</strong> nell\'organizzazione di eventi e circuiti, offre un pacchetto competitivo e completo per promuovere i vostri prodotti nei migliori golf club d\'Italia.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									ESPLORA I CIRCUITI\n					</a>\n		<h4>4,9</h4><p>[progress_icons icon=\"icon-star\" count=\"5\" active=\"5\" background=\"#003C9D\" transparent=\"1\"]</p><p>User reviews</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Giocatori partecipano ogni anno alle nostre gare, in tutta Italia, dalla Valle d\'Aosta alla Sicilia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Le gare giocate su territorio nazionale nei migliori Club d\'Italia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				 ANNI\n		<p>Con passione e professionalità svolgiamo il nostro lavoro per farvi divertire.</p>		\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h2>EQUIPMENT RENTAL</h2>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h4>SKI &amp; SNOWBOARD LESSONS</h4>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h4>OUR RESTAURANT</h4>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n															<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-sep1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h2>BOOK YOUR STAY <br>AND EXPERIENCE <br>THE ADVENTURE</h2>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/contact/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									BOOK A VISIT\n					</a>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '102-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-01-17 04:15:36', '2025-01-17 03:15:36', '', 102, 'http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/?p=1066', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1067, 1, '2025-01-17 04:19:30', '2025-01-17 03:19:30', '<h6>CONTATTI</h6>				\n					<h1>IL GOLF QUANDO E DOVE VUOI </h1>				\n					<h5>Orari Segreteria</h5>				\n		<p>Martedì – Venerdì:<br />10:00 AM – 19:00 PM<br /><br /><br />Sabato – Domenica:<br />08:00 AM – 16:00 PM</p>		\n					<h5>La nostra missione</h5>				\n		<p>Rendiamo il golf accessibile e senza stress, offrendo un servizio semplice, veloce e flessibile. Prenota le tue gare in pochi passaggi, pianifica con libertà e gestisci il tuo tempo senza vincoli, garantendo un’esperienza su misura per ogni golfista.</p>		\n					<h5>La nostra storia</h5>				\n		<p><strong>Dal 2013</strong>, <strong>Garedigolf.it</strong> si distingue per la sua <em>esperienza</em> e <em>passione</em> nell’organizzazione e gestione di circuiti di golf in tutta Italia.</p>\n    <p>Un vero <strong>punto di riferimento</strong> per i golfisti che desiderano scoprire e giocare nei <strong>migliori campi</strong> del Paese, offrendo un accesso esclusivo alle <em>gare più prestigiose</em> nei Golf Club italiani.</p>\n    <p><strong>Garedigolf.it</strong> è l’unica piattaforma che consente di <strong>prenotare</strong> o <strong>acquistare il green fee</strong> per le migliori competizioni, anche con largo anticipo, garantendo il <strong>posto riservato</strong> e sempre il <em>miglior prezzo</em>. Un vero e proprio <strong>“booking”</strong> dedicato al golf!</p>\n    <p>Con un calendario di oltre <strong>150 gare all’anno</strong>, offre agli appassionati la possibilità di giocare con amici sia nei <strong>weekend</strong> che nei <strong>giorni infrasettimanali</strong>.</p>\n    <p><strong>Garedigolf.it</strong> è anche il <strong>partner ideale</strong> per le aziende che desiderano rafforzare la propria immagine e <em>promuovere prodotti e servizi</em> in un ambiente esclusivo e ricco di opportunità, come quello del golf.</p>\n															<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-contact-icon2.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h5>Telefono</h5>				\n					<p><a href=\"tel:+61383766284\">351 888 66 20</a></p>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-contact-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h5>Email</h5>				\n					<p><a href=\"mailto:info@garedigolf.it\">info@garedigolf.it</a></p>				\n			<iframe loading=\"lazy\"\n					src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=2%20Elizabeth%2C%20Victoria%203000%2C%20Australia&#038;t=m&#038;z=13&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near\"\n					title=\"2 Elizabeth, Victoria 3000, Australia\"\n					aria-label=\"2 Elizabeth, Victoria 3000, Australia\"\n			></iframe>\n					<h6>CONTATTI</h6>				\n					<h2>HAI QUALCHE DOMANDA? SCRIVICI!</h2>				\n		[contact-form-7 id=\"106\" title=\"Contact Form\"]		\n															<img width=\"8000\" height=\"808\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1.png 8000w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-500x51.png 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-1200x121.png 1200w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-300x30.png 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-768x78.png 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-1536x155.png 1536w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-2048x207.png 2048w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-150x15.png 150w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/gdg-home-sep1-480x48.png 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:8000px) 100vw, 8000px\" />															\n					<h6>GAREDIGOLF.IT</h6>				\n					<h2>PRENOTA UNA GARA <br>SEMPLICE,  VELOCE<br>A PORTATA DI CLICK</h2>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/contact/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									VAI AL CALENDARIO\n					</a>', 'Contact', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '10-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-01-17 04:19:30', '2025-01-17 03:19:30', '', 10, 'http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/?p=1067', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
