(1118, 1, '2025-01-17 16:45:07', '2025-01-17 15:45:07', '0\n					<h1>GARE</h1>				\n					<h4>NEI MIGLIORI CAMPI D\'ITALIA.</h4>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/resort/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									VAI AL CALENDARIO\n					</a>\n															<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/testimonial-gdg-scontornato-r01tg8ddnd0jcummt0rdwe33m5jgutsa6vc3xunls0.png\" title=\"testimonial-gdg-scontornato\" alt=\"testimonial-gdg-scontornato\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h2>1</h2>				\n					<h4>SEMPLICE</h4>				\n		Prenota facilmente in pochi passaggi: seleziona la <strong>gara</strong>, compila i <strong>dati</strong>, scegli l\'<strong>orario</strong> e il <strong>pagamento</strong>, e ricevi la <strong>conferma</strong> via email.		\n					<h2>2</h2>				\n					<h4>VELOCE</h4>				\n		Pianifica le <strong>gare annuali</strong> con un <strong>prezzo fisso</strong> e <strong>conferma immediata</strong> via email.		\n					<h2>3</h2>				\n					<h4>SENZA VINCOLI</h4>				\n		Nessun <strong>pagamento anticipato</strong> richiesto e possibilità di <strong>cancellare senza penali</strong> fino a 24 ore prima.		\n					<h2>4</h2>				\n					<h4>FLESSIBILE</h4>				\n		<p>Conserva il tuo <strong>green fee</strong> e <strong>riutilizzalo</strong> per una futura gara, senza preoccupazioni.</p>		\n					<h2>LE PROSSIME GARE</h2>				\n					<ul><li><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"750\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-blog-pic2-960x750.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>5 Giugno 2023<h4><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi/\">DIVANI &amp; DIVANI BY NATUZZI</a></h4><hr /><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi/\">Read more</a></li><li><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi-2/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"750\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-blog-pic1-960x750.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>5 Giugno 2023<h4><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi-2/\">DIVANI &#038; DIVANI BY NATUZZI</a></h4><hr /><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/divani-divani-by-natuzzi-2/\">Read more</a></li><li><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skipass-4you/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"750\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-blog-pic3-960x750.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>5 Giugno 2023<h4><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skipass-4you/\">SKIPASS 4YOU</a></h4><hr /><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skipass-4you/\">Read more</a></li><li><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skitouring/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"750\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-blog-pic4-960x750.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>5 Giugno 2023<h4><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skitouring/\">SKITOURING</a></h4><hr /><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/skitouring/\">Read more</a></li><li><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/winter-clothes/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"750\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-blog-pic5-960x750.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>5 Giugno 2023<h4><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/winter-clothes/\">WINTER CLOTHES</a></h4><hr /><a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/2023/06/05/winter-clothes/\">Read more</a></li></ul>\n		<p>CHI<br />SIAMO</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/resort/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									THE MOUNTAIN\n					</a>\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Ski slope</h4><p>5.8 MILES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon2.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Time</h4><p>~15 MINUTES</p>				\n					<figure><img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-mountain-icon3.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure><h4>Prices</h4><p>FROM $8</p>				\n															<img width=\"1882\" height=\"952\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3.webp 1882w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-500x253.webp 500w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-1200x607.webp 1200w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-300x152.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-768x388.webp 768w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-1536x777.webp 1536w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-148x75.webp 148w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-pic3-480x243.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:1882px) 100vw, 1882px\" />															\n		<p>13:00</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>START</h6>				\n		<p>avg 20 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>3KM</h6>				\n		<p>avg 12 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>6KM</h6>				\n		<p>avg 23 km/h</p>		\n															<img width=\"380\" height=\"9\" src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline.webp 380w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-300x7.webp 300w, http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-timeline-150x4.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 380px, 380px\" />															\n					<h6>12KM</h6>				\n					<h6>I CIRCUITI</h6>				\n					<h2>LE MIGLIORI \nECCELLENZE \nITALIANE</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Garedigolf.it, forte dell\'esperienza trentennale di Roberto Bianchi</strong> nell\'organizzazione di eventi e circuiti, offre un pacchetto competitivo e completo per promuovere i vostri prodotti nei migliori golf club d\'Italia.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									ESPLORA I CIRCUITI\n					</a>\n		<h4>4,9</h4><p>[progress_icons icon=\"icon-star\" count=\"5\" active=\"5\" background=\"#003C9D\" transparent=\"1\"]</p><p><a href=\"https://it.trustpilot.com/review/garedigolf.it\">User reviews</a></p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Giocatori partecipano ogni anno alle nostre gare, in tutta Italia, dalla Valle d\'Aosta alla Sicilia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				+\n		<p>Le gare giocate su territorio nazionale nei migliori Club d\'Italia.</p>		\n					<h2>\'</h2>				\n				0\n				 ANNI\n		<p>Con passione e professionalità svolgiamo il nostro lavoro per farvi divertire.</p>		\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h2>EQUIPMENT RENTAL</h2>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h4>SKI &amp; SNOWBOARD LESSONS</h4>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h4>OUR RESTAURANT</h4>				\n																<a href=\"#\">\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-iconarrow.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />								</a>\n															<img src=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/ski3-home-sep1.svg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h6>BESKI</h6>				\n					<h2>BOOK YOUR STAY <br>AND EXPERIENCE <br>THE ADVENTURE</h2>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/contact/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									BOOK A VISIT\n					</a>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '102-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-01-17 16:45:07', '2025-01-17 15:45:07', '', 102, 'http://localhost:8888/garedigolf.it/?p=1118', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
